---
title: "obligation::repay_debt (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_accrue: accrue_interest(CoinType, borrow_index)
    q_accrue --> q_calc_debt: debt_amount = debt.unsafe_debt_amount().ceil()
    q_calc_debt --> q_check_full: debt_amount <= repay_amount?
    q_check_full --> q_full_repay: debt_amount <= repay_amount
    q_check_full --> q_partial_repay: debt_amount > repay_amount
    q_full_repay --> q_cleared: debt.cleared(), residual = amount - debt_amount
    q_partial_repay --> q_decrease: debt.unsafe_decrease(amount), residual = 0
    q_cleared --> q_check_remove: debt.has_debt()?
    q_decrease --> q_check_remove: debt.has_debt()?
    q_check_remove --> q_remove: has_debt == false
    q_check_remove --> [*]: has_debt == true, return residual
    q_remove --> [*]: debts.remove(CoinType), return residual

    note right of q_calc_debt
        INV-001: interest accrued before any repay calculation
        INV-002: debt_amount uses ceiling (slightly favors protocol)
        INV-003: full repay returns residual amount
        INV-004: zero-debt entries removed from obligation.debts
    end note
